    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The measure word 位",
     "texto": [
      "**位** counts people respectfully, for example **一位医生** («a doctor»). To ask where it hurts, you can say **你哪儿疼？**; the side is made clear with **左边** («left») or **右边** («right»).",
      "In English we say «my eye hurts»; in Chinese the person comes first: **我右眼疼** («my right eye hurts»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
